<p>As a critic, I long ago accepted that which films do and do not get a theatrical release is a decision process that lies far above my pay grade and I will only suffer sleepless nights if I ponder them too long. These enigmas are doubly murky when it comes to the seemingly arbitrary path [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.austinchronicle.com/screens/film-review/hope-review-a-monstrous-waste-of-potential/">&lt;i&gt;Hope&lt;/i&gt; Review: A Monstrous Waste of Potential</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.austinchronicle.com">The Austin Chronicle</a>.</p>
