<figure class="alignright size-large"><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" width="780" height="780" data-attachment-id="466939" data-permalink="https://www.austinchronicle.com/contest/win-tickets-to-fortune-feimster-at-acl-live/attachment/austintx_fortunefeimster_tcob_admat_1080x1080/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?fit=1080%2C1080&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1080,1080" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-title="AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?fit=780%2C780&amp;ssl=1" src="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=780%2C780&#038;ssl=1" alt="" class="wp-image-466939" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=400%2C400&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=200%2C200&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=550%2C550&amp;ssl=1 550w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?resize=780%2C780&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080.jpg?w=1080&amp;ssl=1 1080w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AustinTX_FortuneFeimster_TCOB_Admat_1080x1080-1024x1024.jpg?w=370&amp;ssl=1 370w" sizes="(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px" /></figure>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Fortune Feimster is a critically acclaimed comedian, actress, and host known for her upbeat style, unique comedic perspective, and infectious energy.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">She recently wrapped production on the Netflix film <em>The Fifth Wheel</em>, starring alongside Kim Kardashian, Nikki Glaser, and Brenda Song, and directed by Eva Longoria. Feimster can also be seen opposite Will Ferrell in <em>Hawk</em>, Netflix’s golf comedy series streaming now, and is currently on her national “Takin’ Care of Biscuits” tour.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Don&#8217;t miss Fortune Feimster in Austin at ACL Live on<strong> Sunday, September 13</strong>! Get details and tickets <a href="https://www.acllive.com/event/2026-09-13-fortune-feimster-at-8-pm">here</a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Enter to win a pair of tickets!</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Contest ends Thursday, September 10, 2026</em>. <em>See <a href="https://www.austinchronicle.com/contests/#contestregs">regulations</a>.</em></p>


