<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Oatmeal Festival</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Family fun, live music, vendors, food, craft beer, and games are all part of the excitement for festival named for a ghost town.&nbsp;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 26, Bertram, <a href="http://www.oatmealfestival.org">www.oatmealfestival.org</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Stars Over Wimberley Benefit Concert Series</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The series brings Texas musicians to town in support of local high school scholarships this month featuring Tony Kamel &amp; Kym Warner&nbsp;with Pat Byrne.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 30, Wimberley, <a href="http://www.starsoverwimberley.org">www.starsoverwimberley.org</a></p>
</div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>PANHANDLE PLAINS</strong></h2>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" width="780" height="718" data-attachment-id="466862" data-permalink="https://www.austinchronicle.com/columns/day-trips-beyond-september-events-roundup/attachment/sept10_buddy-holly/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept10_Buddy-Holly.jpg?fit=1800%2C1658&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1800,1658" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-title="Sept10_Buddy Holly" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;Join the celebration in Lubbock of what would have been Buddy Holly’s 90th birthday.&lt;/p&gt;
