<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Buddy Holly’s 90th Birthday Bash</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Celebrate what would have been the music legend’s birthday with tours, music, and more.&nbsp;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 7, Lubbock, <a href="http://www.buddyhollycenter.org">www.buddyhollycenter.org</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Hoodoo Mural Festival</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Music meets art as world-class muralists add new outdoor art to Amarillo during a high-energy music festival and interactive art show.&nbsp;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 26, Amarillo, <a href="http://www.hoodoomural.com">www.hoodoomural.com</a></p>
</div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>PRAIRIES AND LAKES</strong></h2>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Spark! Places of Innovation</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Organized by the Smithsonian, this exhibition highlights stories of rural ingenuity from across America. Taylor’s exhibit brings that story home, showcasing the people, industries, and ideas that transformed a small railroad town into a thriving Central Texas community.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept.1-27, Taylor, <a href="https://taylortx.gov/1415/Spark-Places-of-Innovation---Smithsonian" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">taylortx.gov</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Kolache Festival</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Experience the area’s rich Czech heritage, lively entertainment, and those delicious homemade doughy pillows of goodness: kolaches.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 12, Caldwell, <a href="http://www.burlesoncountytx.com/kolache-fest/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">www.burlesoncountytx.com/kolache-fest</a></p>
</div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" width="780" height="585" data-attachment-id="466864" data-permalink="https://www.austinchronicle.com/columns/day-trips-beyond-september-events-roundup/attachment/olympus-digital-camera-33/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?fit=1570%2C1177&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1570,1177" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-title="OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;Take a walk back in time at the Gault Site tours.&lt;/p&gt;
" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?fit=780%2C585&amp;ssl=1" src="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=780%2C585&#038;ssl=1" alt="" class="wp-image-466864" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=1024%2C768&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=600%2C450&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=768%2C576&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=1536%2C1152&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=1200%2C900&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=800%2C600&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=400%2C300&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=200%2C150&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=550%2C412&amp;ssl=1 550w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?resize=780%2C585&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site.jpg?w=1570&amp;ssl=1 1570w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept11_Gault-Site-1024x768.jpg?w=370&amp;ssl=1 370w" sizes="(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Take a walk back in time at the Gault Site tours. <span class="image-credit"><span class="credit-label-wrapper">Credit:</span> Gerald E. McLeod</span></figcaption></figure>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Gault Site Guided Tours</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Investigations at the Gault Site have helped establish that people were in the Americas as early as 20,000 years ago, far longer than many archaeologists had believed.&nbsp;The two-hour walk features interpretive kiosks at spots where the excavations took place and history-making discoveries were made. The tour ends with hands-on displays and replicas of artifacts recovered during excavations.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 12, 26, Florence, <a href="http://www.gaultschool.org/tours">www.gaultschool.org/tours</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Grapefest</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The&nbsp;largest wine festival in the Southwest&nbsp;returns for four unforgettable days featuring exceptional wine encounters and exciting festivities celebrating the fifth-largest wine-producing state in the nation.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 17-20, Grapevine, <a href="http://www.grapevinetexasusa.com/grapefest">www.grapevinetexasusa.com/grapefest</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Plano Balloon Festival</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">One the largest hot air balloon showcases in the state returns for its 47th year with daylong events.&nbsp;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 17-20, Plano, <a href="http://www.planoballoonfest.org">www.planoballoonfest.org</a></p>
</div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" width="780" height="527" data-attachment-id="466865" data-permalink="https://www.austinchronicle.com/columns/day-trips-beyond-september-events-roundup/attachment/sept12_giddings-library/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?fit=1800%2C1217&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1800,1217" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-title="Sept12_Giddings Library" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;The Giddings Public Library hosts the 20th literary festival of regional writers. &lt;/p&gt;
" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?fit=780%2C527&amp;ssl=1" src="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=780%2C527&#038;ssl=1" alt="" class="wp-image-466865" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=1024%2C692&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=600%2C406&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=768%2C519&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=1536%2C1039&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=1200%2C811&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=550%2C372&amp;ssl=1 550w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=800%2C541&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=780%2C527&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?resize=400%2C270&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library.jpg?w=1800&amp;ssl=1 1800w, https://i0.wp.com/www.austinchronicle.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sept12_Giddings-Library-1024x692.jpg?w=370&amp;ssl=1 370w" sizes="(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">The Giddings Public Library hosts the 20th literary festival of regional writers.  <span class="image-credit"><span class="credit-label-wrapper">Credit:</span> Gerald E. McLeod</span></figcaption></figure>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Word Wrangler Festival</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Since 2006, the festival has celebrated Texas authors. In addition to honoring Texas writers, the book festival gives the community an opportunity to meet word wranglers and learn about the writing craft.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 25-27, Giddings, <a href="http://www.giddingspubliclibrary.org/word-wrangler">www.giddingspubliclibrary.org/word-wrangler</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Wendish Fest</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Honor Wendish culture on the St. Paul’s Lutheran Church Picnic Grounds with noodle making, sausage making, and other ethnic events. Six miles south of town on CR 212.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 27, Giddings, <a href="http://www.texaswends.org/wendish-fest">www.texaswends.org/wendish-fest</a></p>
</div>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>SOUTH TEXAS</strong></h2>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Beer Tasting Cruises</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Every Friday in September,&nbsp;Ambler Texas Kitchen is teaming up with&nbsp;GO RIO River Cruises for rides along the San Antonio River featuring handcrafted beer selections paired with delicious dishes.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 4, 11, 18, 25, San Antonio, <a href="http://www.goriocruises.com/specialty-cruises">www.goriocruises.com/specialty-cruises</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">“<strong>Lowrider Culture in the United States / Cultura Lowrider en los Estados Unidos</strong>”</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This traveling exhibition is based on research from the Smithsonian and includes objects from lowriding art and trade. Lowriding is a quintessential Latino/a tradition started by Mexican American communities in the 1940s to assert their space and empower their lives. This unique car-making tradition is infused with Latino/a soul, entrepreneurship, and ingenuity.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Through Oct. 15, McAllen, <a href="https://theimasonline.org">theimasonline.org</a></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Wild &amp; Scenic Film Festival</strong> </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A free community event celebrating nature, conservation, and the outdoors through a collection of inspiring films. Enjoy live music, local food vendors in Confluence Park 6:30-10:30pm.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Sept. 26, San Antonio, <a href="https://wildandscenicfilmfestival.org">https://wildandscenicfilmfestival.org</a></p>
</div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide" />



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Gerald McLeod has been traveling around Texas and beyond for his “Day Trips” column for more than 35 years. Keep up to date with his journeys on his <a href="https://www.austinchronicle.com/authors/gerald-e-mcleod/">archive page</a> and follow him on <a href="https://www.facebook.com/pages/category/Writer/Austin-Chronicle-Day-Trips-186439738061014/">Facebook</a>.</em></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.austinchronicle.com/columns/day-trips-beyond-september-events-roundup/">Day Trips &amp; Beyond: September Events Roundup</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.austinchronicle.com">The Austin Chronicle</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
